ShareVaultAdminTest
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert for every setter and for acknowledgeDeviation
├── given a numeric parameter setter
│   ├── when the value is outside its bounds
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the value is inside its bounds
│       └── it should store it
├── given an address setter
│   ├── when the address must not be zero and is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the address is valid
│       └── it should store it
├── given the deployer constructs the vault
│   ├── when usdc or the fee recipient is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the arguments are valid
│       └── it should expose the share token metadata
└── given ownership transfer
    └── it should need the new owner to accept
